+## Behaviour worth knowing
+
+### The C button keeps the reader's case
+
+On a case page, CMS's `openCaseworkTools` adds `q={"caseId":<id>}` to `CASEWORK_TOOLS_URL`, the same
+way the P button does. `/launch/<key>` turns that into the case's overview page
+(`/WorkManagementApp/CaseOverview?CaseId=<id>`) on the target's OutSystems host. Without a valid
+`q` it lands on the casework home page, as it always has.
